WEBVTT

00:03:29.664 --> 00:03:35.294
to help villagers visualize the influence
and impact not only of their land,

00:03:35.336 --> 00:03:40.299
but also of their daily actions
beyond their geographic reach.

00:03:40.341 --> 00:03:42.510
To give them a sense of importance

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:46.597
to counteract how they felt
abandoned all these years.

00:03:47.223 --> 00:03:51.018
And we also help give them back
the power of decision

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:53.396
by instigating curiosity

00:03:53.437 --> 00:03:56.440
on alternative livelihoods
that they can trial on.

00:03:56.983 --> 00:04:01.487
All of this in an effort to bring back
ownership of their heritage